ehi manye ityanena yuktaṃ lṛḍantaṃ krīḍāyām | ehi manye bhaktaṃ bhokṣyase nahi bhokṣyase bhuktaṃ tattvatithibhiḥ | prahāse kim | ehi manyase odanaṃ bhokṣye iti suṣṭhu manyase | gatyarthaloṭā lṛṭ-3958 ityanenaiva siddhe niyamārtho|ayamārambhaḥ | ehimanyeyukte prahāsa eva nānyatra | ehi manyase odanaṃ bhokṣye |

3954: jātvapūrvam (8-1-47)

avidyamānapūrvaṃ yajjātu tena yuktaṃ tiñantaṃ nānudāttam | jātu bhokṣyase | apūrvaṃ kim | kaṭaṃ jātu kariṣyasi |

3955: kiṃvṛttaṃ ca ciduttaram (8-1-48)

avidyamānapūrvaṃ ciduttaṃ yatkiṃvṛttaṃ tena yuktaṃ tiñantaṃ nānudāttam | vibhaktyantaṃ ḍataraḍatamāntaṃ kimo rūpaṃ kiṃvṛttam | kaścidbhuñkte | kataraścit | katamaścidvā | ciduttaraṃ kim | ko bhuñkte | apūrvamityeva | rāmaḥ kiṃcitpaṭhati |

3956: āho utāho cā|anantaram (8-1-49)

āho utāho ityābhyāṃ yuktaṃ tiñantaṃ nānudāttam | āho utāho vā bhuñkte | anantaramityeva | śeṣe vibhāṣāṃ vakṣyati | apūrveti kim | deva āho bhuñkte |

3957: śeṣe vibhāṣā (8-1-50)

ābhyāṃ yuktaṃ vyavahitaṃ tiñantaṃ vānudāttam | āho devaḥ pacati |

3958: gatyarthaloṭā lṛṇna cetkārakaṃ sarvānyat (8-1-51)

gatyarthānāṃ loṭā yuktaṃ tiñantaṃ nānudāttaṃ yatraiva kārake loṭ tatraiva lṛḍapi cet | āgaccha deva grāmaṃ drakṣyasyenam | uhyantāṃ devadattena śālayo rāmeṇa bokṣyante | gatyarthe kim | paca deva odanaṃ bhokṣyase|annam | loṭā kim | āgaccherdeva grāmaṃ drakṣyasyenam | lṛṭ kim | āgaccha deva grāmaṃ paśyasyenam | na cediti kim | āgaccha deva grāmaṃ pitā te odanaṃ bhokṣyate | sarvaṃ kim | āgaccha deva grāmaṃ tvaṃ cāhaṃ ca drakṣyāva enamityatrāpi nighātaniṣedho yathā syāt | yalloḍantasya kārakaṃ taccānyacca lṛḍantenocyate |

3959: loṭ ca (8-1-52)

loḍantaṃ gatyarthaloṭā yuktaṃ nānudāttam | āgaccha deva grāmaṃ paśya | gatyartheti kim | paca devaudanaṃ bhuñkṣvainam | loṭ kim | āgaccha deva grāmaṃ paśyasi | na cetkārakaṃ sarvānyadityeva | āgaccha deva grāmaṃ tvaṃ cāhaṃ ca paśyāvaḥ | yogavibhāga uttarārthaḥ |

3960: vibhāṣitaṃ sopasargamanuttamam (8-1-53)

loḍantaṃ gatyarthaloṭā yuktaṃ tiñantaṃ vānudāttam | āgaccha deva grāmaṃ praviśa | sopasargaṃ kim | āgaccha deva grāmaṃ paśya | anuttamaṃ kim | āgacchāni deva grāmaṃ praviśāni |

3961: hanta ca (8-1-54)

hantetyanena yuktamanuttamaṃ loḍantaṃ vānudāttam | hanta praviśa | sopasargamityeva | hanta kuru | nipātrairyadyadi 3967 iti nighātapratiṣedhaḥ | anuttamaṃ kim | hanta prabhuñjāvahai |

3962: āma ekāntaramāmantritamanantike (8-1-55)

āmaḥ paramekapadāntaritamāmantritaṃ nānudāttam | ām pacasi devadatta3 | ekāntaraṃ kim | ām prapacasi devadatta3 | āmantritaṃ kim | ām pacati devadattaḥ | anantike kim | ām pacasi devadatta |

3963: yaddhituparaṃ chandasi (8-1-56)

tiñantaṃ nānudāttam | udasṛjo yadañgiraḥ (u\_dasṛ\'jo\_ yada\'ñgiraḥ) | uśanti hi (u\_śanti\_ hi) | ākhyāsyāmi tu te | nipātairyat-3937iti hica 3941 iti tupaśya-3946 iti ca siddhe niyamārthamidam | etaireva parabhūtairyoge nānyairiti | jāye svārohāvaihi | ehīti gatyarthaloṭā yuktasya loḍantasya nighāto bhavati |

