ahayuktā prathamā tiñvibhaktirnānudāttā nānāprayoge niyogekṣiyāyāṃ ca | tvamaha grāmaṃ gaccha | kṣiyāyām | svayamaharathena yāti3 upādhyayaṃ padātiṃ nayati |

3969: cāhalopa evetyavadhāraṇam (8-1-62)

ca aha etayorlope prathamā tiñvibhaktirnānudāttā deva eva grāmaṃ gacchatu | deva evāraṇyaṃ gacchatu | grāmaraṇyaṃ ca gacchatvityarthaḥ | deva evaṃ grāmaṃ gacchatu | rāma evāraṇyaṃ gacchatu | grāmaṃ kevalamaraṇyaṃ kevalaṃ gacchatvityarthaṃ | ihāhalopaḥ | sa ca kevalārthaḥ | avadhāraṇaṃ kim | deva kveva bhokṣyase | na kvicidityarthaḥ | anavaklṛptāveva |

3970: cādilope vibhāṣā (8-1-63)

cavāhāhaivānāṃ lope prathamā tiñvibhaktirnānudāttā | calope | indravājeṣu no|ava (indra\_vāje\'ṣu no|ava) | śuklā vrīhayo bhavanti | śvetā gā ājyāya duhanti | vālope | vrīhibhiryajeta | yavairyajeta |

